WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.700
Start and controls
Take a seat and press Ready. The host starts when everyone is ready. Your cards or dice are at the bottom.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:19.000
Follow the turn prompt. Wait for animations to finish; an expired turn is played automatically. Use Return to room after settlement.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Hearts | Keep penalties low
Four players receive 13 cards each. Watch Demo N. Each heart costs one penalty point; the spade queen costs thirteen.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:48.200
Select three cards, then confirm
Choose three cards and confirm the pass. Other selections stay private; cards move only after all four submit.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:59.000
Pass left, right, across, then hold. Repeat this four-hand cycle.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Club two opens the first trick
After passing, the club-two holder leads. Play clockwise; the highest card in the led suit takes the trick.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Follow the led suit when possible
Click a legal card to play; on phones, select and confirm with another tap. The trick winner leads next. There is no trump.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Rule note | First trick and broken hearts
Penalty discards on the first trick and leading hearts have restrictions.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:59.000
When void in clubs on trick one, play a nonpenalty card if possible. Hearts must be broken before leading them, unless only hearts remain.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:15.500
Complete all thirteen tricks
The rest of this hand is accelerated, preserving every legal play. The next hand is dealt after settlement.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:29.000
Shooting the moon: taking all 26 penalty points scores zero for the shooter and adds 26 to each opponent.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:03:29.000
Accelerate the remaining hands
Repeat passing, thirteen tricks and scoring. Once anyone reaches 100, finish that hand and end the match.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:38.900
Hearts | Compare match totals
Review cumulative penalties and hand history. Lowest total wins, including tied lowest scores.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:47.000
Return to the room for another match, starting with a left pass again.
